{"entryId":"1745","paragraphs":[{"sourceId":"heilprin:sefaria-warsaw:ta:1745:1","sourceSha256":"b1ad710e78b384a83cb38da77029ed5d195dd12436e32e081b5e39e97338a8eb","englishSha256":"d926d481e92513d96fec974a9bd5b9a978dfb7c005d2ccb64288c6ca0e650b5f","citations":[{"id":"1745:1:citation-01","he":[0,30],"en":[20,43],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Midrash_Tanchuma%2C_Achrei_Mot.3.1"},"reference":"Midrash Tanchuma, Achrei Mot:3:1","assessment":"The checked Tanchuma explicitly names Yochanan bar Yudan of Galila, as does internal entry 1856. The same opening is attributed to Yudan of Galaya in the Tanchuma Buber and Rabbah witnesses. This is a disagreement in attribution for the shared homily.","evidence":[{"reference":"Midrash Tanchuma, Achrei Mot:3:1","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Midrash_Tanchuma%2C_Achrei_Mot.3.1"},"witness":"Midrash Tanchuma -- Torat Emet"},{"reference":"Seder HaDorot 1856:1","target":{"entry":1856,"paragraph":1},"witness":"Pinned Warsaw digital witness"},{"reference":"Midrash Tanchuma Buber, Achrei Mot:4:1","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Midrash_Tanchuma_Buber%2C_Achrei_Mot.4.1"},"witness":"Midrash Tanhuma haKadum veHaYashan, S. Buber, 1885"},{"reference":"Vayikra Rabbah 20:4","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Vayikra_Rabbah_20.4"},"witness":"Midrash Rabbah -- TE"}]}],"inlineHebrew":[0],"holds":[{"raw":"ר' יודן דמן גלילא ר' יוחנן בנו","reason":"The named Tanchuma attests the relationship in this version. The parallel with a different attribution leaves any identification of Yudan of Galila and Yudan of Galaya open.","evidence":[{"reference":"Midrash Tanchuma, Achrei Mot:3:1","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Midrash_Tanchuma%2C_Achrei_Mot.3.1"},"witness":"Midrash Tanchuma -- Torat Emet"},{"reference":"Seder HaDorot 1856:1","target":{"entry":1856,"paragraph":1},"witness":"Pinned Warsaw digital witness"},{"reference":"Midrash Tanchuma Buber, Achrei Mot:4:1","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Midrash_Tanchuma_Buber%2C_Achrei_Mot.4.1"},"witness":"Midrash Tanhuma haKadum veHaYashan, S. Buber, 1885"},{"reference":"Vayikra Rabbah 20:4","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Vayikra_Rabbah_20.4"},"witness":"Midrash Rabbah -- TE"}]}],"notes":[{"text":"Record the Tanchuma patronymic and parallel Rabbah and Buber attributions, with no merger with the nearby Galaya notice.","references":[],"urls":[]}],"comparisonEvidence":[{"reference":"Midrash Tanchuma, Achrei Mot:3:1","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Midrash_Tanchuma%2C_Achrei_Mot.3.1"},"witness":"Midrash Tanchuma -- Torat Emet"},{"reference":"Seder HaDorot 1856:1","target":{"entry":1856,"paragraph":1},"witness":"Pinned Warsaw digital witness"},{"reference":"Midrash Tanchuma Buber, Achrei Mot:4:1","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Midrash_Tanchuma_Buber%2C_Achrei_Mot.4.1"},"witness":"Midrash Tanhuma haKadum veHaYashan, S. Buber, 1885"},{"reference":"Vayikra Rabbah 20:4","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Vayikra_Rabbah_20.4"},"witness":"Midrash Rabbah -- TE"}]}],"entryEvidence":[]}
